ndexed":true,"sha256":"c62fadabe18c688c1f13bd523e2d703876559ce5bd2026152547232df755a681","bytes":548,"dropped_lines":0,"n_chunks":1,"citation_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","reused":false},"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_robot_masters_20261125.txt":{"indexed":true,"sha256":"5906ca4dd558d2d7182242c1c54acab8c873197597fe4a88d58a5bbab100c656","bytes":1182,"dropped_lines":0,"n_chunks":1,"citation_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","reused":false},"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_progression_rewards_20261125.txt":{"indexed":true,"sha256":"f11295517fc622dacdff20fd62d95056d31cc518c22356c7d919291b5a896f42","bytes":984,"dropped_lines":0,"n_chunks":1,"citation_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","reused":false},"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_victory_scores_20261125.txt":{"indexed":true,"sha256":"a8684e89feee81ed989dc1cf4e92dfb8b200111e7485fa4158f82973fb57853d","bytes":488,"dropped_lines":0,"n_chunks":1,"citation_sha256":"44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a","reused":false}},"chunks":[{"chunk_id":"e54e2ae95c0d","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_coordinate_facts_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_mm1_object_ram_table","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":25,"text":"TASVideos GameResources：洛克人1坐标系统（逐字摘录）\nCoordinate system\nIn Rockman and Rockman 2, every object of the game has the following properties:\nScreen number (00―FF), it tells which screen the object resides in.\nX position (00.00―FF.FF), it tells where in the screen the object is in.\nY position (00.00―FF.FF), it tells where in the screen the object is in.\nX speed (−80.00―7F.FF).\nY speed (−80.00―7F.FF).\nThe position of the object has 8 bits of decimal part,\nbut only the integer part can be observed on the screen.\nY coordinates increase towards the bottom of the screen\nX coordinates increase towards the right\nNegative Y speed means falling, positive Y speed means ascending\nX speed is always positive. It is subtracted or added depending on Rockman’s facing.","text_sha":"cdd73acb482ce617dbb086e6f1dcccdc4fde3785","dl":138},{"chunk_id":"80852a424f3f","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_object_ram_table_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_mm1_object_ram_table","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"table","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":17,"text":"TASVideos GameResources：洛克人1对象 RAM 表（逐字摘录）\nGame Screen# X (hi,lo) Xspd (hi,lo) Y (hi,lo) Yspd (hi,lo)\nRockman 1 $460 $480:$4A0 $4C0:$4E0 $600:$620 $660:$680\nRockman 2 $440 $460:$480 $600:$620 $4A0:$4C0 $640:$660\nRockman 3 $380 $360:$340 no RAM address? $3C0:$3A0 $460:$440\nRockman 4 $348 $330:$318 no RAM address? $378:$360 $3F0:$3D8\nRockman 5\nRockman 6\nThe variables for object # n can be found by adding n to each address.\nBoss has n =1 in RM1/2, Rockman always has n =0.","text_sha":"a3a274f12c3dabc52020b343bd2efc590cafa54c","dl":130},{"chunk_id":"fea411ef037d","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_bizhawk_memory_write_fact_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_bizhawk_faq_write_refresh","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["基础档案","帧数据"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":10,"text":"TASVideos BizHawk FAQ：内存覆盖与 memory write callback（逐字摘录）\nMemory Manipulation\nI'm trying to cheat/poke/freeze a memory address, but it keeps changing\nBizhawk can only overwrite your address once per frame, so if the game changes it more frequently, you'll have to use memory write callbacks to track when the game does so, to overwrite it yourself right after that.\nBut since some callbacks happen before the event, and some happen after (depending on the core), you may have to change CPU registers instead, where the value initially comes from upon the memory write.\nNote that not every Bizhawk core implements memory callbacks and register editing.","text_sha":"beec6d9930fd83144c2c1761343ff9207c0b60d5","dl":113},{"chunk_id":"6678dae960d3","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_fm2_import_reference_fact_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_forum_19912_fm2_import","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"reference_only","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":18,"text":"TASVideos Forum 19912：FM2 导入 BizHawk（参考性社区流程，逐字摘录）\nLocation: The land down under.\nUseless topic is useless.\nIf your file is in the fm3 format (TAS Editor)\nFile > Export to FM2\n(You know the thing you should do before submitting, instead of submitting an evil fm3 file, which is possible.)\nNow within BizHawk.","text_sha":"863b31f0952991b84cea8a3ea5e4ad34b575dabe","dl":62},{"chunk_id":"96d1b8965f77","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_segmented_tas_reference_fact_20261125.txt","source_id":"tasvideos_glossary_segmented","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"reference_only","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-23","element_types":["基础档案","说明书"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":8,"text":"TASVideos Glossary：segmented movie 通用术语（参考性，逐字摘录）\nSegmented, Multi-segment\nMade in parts.\nA segmented movie consists of individual levels or sections of a game which each are played separately.\nMaking of segmented movies can be seen as a limited form of re-recording: instead of saving/loading at any point at will, saving/loading is only done at segment borders.","text_sha":"984ad5a966813b3e0defd7ad4f7e821a9a49269a","dl":66},{"chunk_id":"48b6ea0137ff","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_weapon_ram_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"本机实测：洛克人1武器 RAM 地址与值表（隔离候选摘录）","lang":"zh","line_start":2,"line_end":2,"text":"来源：测试问题与闸门说明书.md 第712-716行；逐字摘录，不含撤回段。","text_sha":"190f40573e0c54836882be06470628bb460d9cba","dl":25},{"chunk_id":"a2eaf6d24f0a","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_weapon_ram_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"33.1 owned/current 地址实证与三条撤回","lang":"zh","line_start":4,"line_end":7,"text":"- **owned=0x5D 位场**（bit=菜单行：1B 2E 3G 4I 5C 6F 7M，bit0=P 不画行）；写 0xFF 菜单出全 7 行、\n写 0x40 只出 F 行（`ramdiff/w/bit_40/f0029.png` 亲看）。文献\"0x5D=all_stages_complete\"单一语义撤回。\n- **current_weapon=0x5F**，值表 0P 1C 2I 3B 4F 5E 6G 7M：菜单逐行装备 + `attempt(ram=)` 冻结差分\n（`ramdiff/e/equip_table.json`），装色亲看互证（Bomb 绿 / Elec 奶油 / Fire 红 / Ice 淡紫）。","text_sha":"91abddc9bde17dafe93d75ca5476dccedbdc4f09","dl":96},{"chunk_id":"5f9623fbdde5","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_position_probe_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"本机实测：洛克人1对象表定位 T1 五臂试验（隔离候选摘录）","lang":"zh","line_start":2,"line_end":2,"text":"来源：场景取得方法_调研与设计_2026-11-23.md 第44-58行；逐字摘录。","text_sha":"cf181aee4b67ec99862f80bba41f7738a7beb5fb","dl":25},{"chunk_id":"65a638ace495","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_local_position_probe_excerpt_20261125.txt","source_id":"local_mm1_taspipe_measurements","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["帧数据","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"3. T1 实测：权威表 vs 派生副本（全部臂等长 = 4 空帧，同一个 root `cut_spawn.state`）","lang":"zh","line_start":5,"line_end":17,"text":"| 臂 | 补丁 | 读回 `$0022` / `$0025` | 相机 `$001A/$001B` | 与基线像素差 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `ctl_none` | 无 | 128 / 148 | 0 / 0 | 0（恒量基线） |\n| `derived_ctl` | `$0022=200` | **128** / 148 | 0 / 0 | **0** |\n| `x_only` | `$0480=176` | **168** / 148 | **40** / 0 | **20,042（34.95%）** |\n| `scr12` | `$0460=12` | 232 / 148 | 0 / **3** | 566 |\n| `bossroom` | `$0460=12,$0480=32,$0600=84` | 232 / **84** | 0 / 3 | 566 |\n看图定案（`F:/taspipe_scratch/mm_nav/t1/t1_sheet.png`、`t1_zoom_right.png`）：\n- `derived_ctl` 与基线**逐像素相同** ⇒ 写显示副本 = 完全无效，不是\"没测出来\"。\n- `x_only` 相机整屏右滚 40 px ⇒ 写 `$0480`（X hi）**真的把角色搬动了**，游戏从这张表重算显示量。\n- `bossroom` 角色被抬到半空（y=84，画面右上角悬着） ⇒ 写 `$0600`（Y hi）**逐字生效**。\n- `scr12`：写 `$0460=12` 被引擎重算成 **3**，X 同步变 232 ⇒ 屏号是派生量，不能指定房间。","text_sha":"f4189d02b2ecdbf7de8fa94ecaef3015a17fd397","dl":196},{"chunk_id":"03e122ec5180","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_controls_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":13,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：A键 B键 控制动作 跳跃 射击 十字键操作（美国NES手册第8页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\nButton A：按 A 键使 MEGA MAN 跳跃。\n> Button A: Press to make MEGA MAN jump.\nButton B：按 B 键射击。\n> Button B: Press to fire.\nControl Pad：左使 MEGA MAN 向左移动，右使其向右移动，上使其向上跳，下使其蹲下。\n> MEGA MAN moves left. MEGA MAN moves right. MEGA MAN leaps upward. MEGA MAN crouches down.","text_sha":"7fec09479c378257695773278b08b85d3c939d32","dl":134},{"chunk_id":"5d40dd4e0f83","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_stage_select_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":13,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：START 选关 开始遭遇战（美国NES手册第9页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\n按 START 后显示六名 Robot Master 敌人；用控制 pad 的右端选择要挑战的敌人。\n> Press START Button. Six of MEGA MAN's seven empire enemies will be displayed on the TV/monitor screen.\n再次按 START 开始与玩家选定的敌人角色遭遇。\n> Re-press START Button. To begin encounter with the enemy character selected by the player.\n每击败一个关键角色，其背景变黑；Dr. Wily 的六个机器人手下全部消灭且所有背景出现后，Dr. Wily 自动出现，进入第七最终关。\n> Every time a key character is defeated by MEGA MAN, the background of enemy's regime becomes black.","text_sha":"3780e8397fbddd801c59a7532c5ddf82f80c2600","dl":197},{"chunk_id":"18a00ca4cb83","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_energy_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":10,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：Energy Meter 生命能量 受伤 能量胶囊（美国NES手册第4页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\n游戏画面左上方的 Energy Meter 用于监测 MEGA MAN 的能量水平。\n> A thermometer-shaped MEGA MAN \"Energy Meter\" appearing upper left in game-playing scenes serves to monitor MEGA MAN's power levels.\nMEGA MAN 被敌人击中时能量会减少；赢得 energy capsule 可恢复并提升能量。\n> If and when MEGA MAN is bodily struck or hit with enemy projectiles, degrees of energy are lost.","text_sha":"00bc73b97afec78c940264898670be1af5a6ca06","dl":145},{"chunk_id":"8adaa41c71e9","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_bonus_items_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":13,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：1UP 生命能量 武器能量 Yashichi 奖励符号（美国NES手册第15页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\n1 UP 增加一名玩家。\n> 1 UP. It adds one player.\nlife energy 图标增加玩家生命能量；weapon energy 图标增加玩家武器能量。\n> The player's life energy increases. The player's weapon energy increases.\nYashichi 是 100,000 points bonus。\n> Yashichi. 100,000 points bonus.","text_sha":"4acc1605146fa8328d2585e31f01027592af4333","dl":123},{"chunk_id":"7eb5f0df8259","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_magnet_beam_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":10,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：Magnet Beam 出现关卡 制造台阶 向上攀爬（美国NES手册第5及15页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\nMagnet Beam 在 Elecman 关卡中途出现。\n> A Magnet Beam will appear at the middle of the Elecman stage. Snare the Magnet Beam to create steps for climbing upward.\n取得 Magnet Beam 后可制造台阶，用于向上攀爬。\n> Magnet Beam. The player can create a step to go up.","text_sha":"2b6527cfc52d93755b762da290ccdf13f2ea169d","dl":125},{"chunk_id":"9e1b150976d6","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_robot_masters_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":22,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：六名 Robot Master 身份 职业 专长（美国NES手册第6至7页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\nCutman 设计为 lumberjack，使用强力锯状工具并能穿过巨大森林。\n> Cutman: Designed to function as a lumberjack ... capable of gnawing through giant forest timbers.\nIceman 用于 sub-zero 极寒环境，能在极端气候下行动。\n> Iceman: Impervious to chilling sub-zero temperatures ... under extreme climatic conditions.\nGutsman 能举起并搬运巨大石块。\n> Gutsman: ... capable of lifting and transporting huge boulders.\nBombman 能徒手掀翻强力爆炸物，为 Dr. Wright 的建设项目开垦土地。\n> Bombman: ... utilizes intensely explosive explosives to clear lands for Dr. Wright's construction projects.\nFireman 用火焰融化并铸造金属。\n> Fireman: Melts and molds metals with flame-throwing torch ...\nElecman 计划承担电气操作及超级核电厂供电。\n> Elecman: ... planned for conducting electrical operations ... supervising nuclear power plants.","text_sha":"f26d07a4aa9caa9b19d0a3cefca2527469bc148c","dl":222},{"chunk_id":"c911e2956cca","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_progression_rewards_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":13,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：击败六名 Robot Master 获得新火力 Wily 最终关 仅用一次（美国NES手册第5及9页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\n每次 MEGA MAN 成功单挑击败六名对手之一，就会获得一种新 firepower，进入最终关挑战 Dr. Wily 时使用。\n> Each time MEGA MAN successfully out-duels each of his six foes, he acquires new firepower as MEGA MAN enters final stage to defeat evil Dr. Wily.\n新获得的武器只能在与 Dr. Wily 的战斗中使用一次。\n> All MEGA MAN must use the newly-acquired armament wisely, for he can use them just once while engaged in battle with Dr. Wily.\n击败 Wily 所有机器人手下且全部背景出现后，Wily 自动出现，第七最终关开始。\n> Dr. Wily appears automatically. It is now time for the player to conquer Dr. Wily in his seventh and final stage.","text_sha":"e8c1fe77a115db29998242cf09247e1f6aac7989","dl":224},{"chunk_id":"501f930d1588","path":"知识库P1_20261118/megaman1_candidate_v2_manual_20261125/evidence/mm1_manual_victory_scores_20261125.txt","source_id":"archive_mega_man_nes_us_manual","revision":"megaman1_nes_us","game_id":"megaman1","platform":"NES","authority":"authoritative","citation_authority":{},"status":"verified_read","last_verified":"2026-11-25","element_types":["说明书","基础档案"],"kind":"prose","heading":"","lang":"zh","line_start":1,"line_end":10,"text":"洛克人1 官方说明书：Robot Master 胜利得分 Dr. Wily 200000 分（美国NES手册第10及14页）\n来源：Capcom 美国 NES 官方说明书扫描件。\n核验：已读扫描页；中文为说明，英文为短引文；未收全本。\n每击败一名 Robot Master 可得 50,000 至 100,000 points。\n> Earn From 50,000 To 100,000 Points Per Victory.\nDr. Wily 价值 200,000 Points，出现在最终关。\n> Dr. Wily. 200,000 Points. It appears on the final stage.","text_sha":"57204822d19942b0967d33097f66ca63e2bec004","dl":113}],"postings":{"tasvid